      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>De Montfort University is a multidisciplinary British university in Dubai. Initially founded in 1870, the institution has evolved into a worldwide hub of learning housing approximately 26,000 students from all over the world.</p><p>Known for its high quality learning and research, lecturers at the university have earned awards in the National Teaching Fellowship awards: the most prestigious awards for excellence in higher education.</p><p>Over 2,700 international students enrol in courses at the university each year, making the campus a multicultural environment.</p> <p>De Montfort University Dubai has many first-rate facilities to offer students due to their continued investment in the student experience. The cafeterias and dining options present students with healthy food choices. Student common areas are designed for both socialising and relaxation. </p> <p><strong>Student Life</strong></p> <p>Student life is rated highly at De Montfort University Dubai. The DMU student council actively help students to find internships and job placements, while coordinating campus events for students to enjoy recreationally. The on-site sports facilities improve mental focus and provide students with the chance to keep fit and healthy. Making friends is easy thanks to the student representatives and plethora of student clubs on campus. Student Service Center serves as a one-stop, single point of contact for all student support queries. Sector-specific careers fairs and insight events are organised at DMU Dubai Campus throughout the academic year for students to propel their career forward.</p> ",
