    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The university provides multiple on-campus accommodation options for students, including international students. All accommodation is located close by to the university campus and the staff ensure to maintain a safe and secure environment so students can settle comfortably into university life.</p><p>There are student housing blocks segregated by gender and containing facilities such as a student lounge, gym, en-suite rooms, laundry machines, an indoor games area, food court, car parking and even a shuttle bus to easily travel to the nearby shopping centres.</p>",
